      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures does hydraulic ramp loading provide during Car Transportation In Bagaha?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramps lift the vehicle gently onto the carrier using motorized platforms, eliminating manual pushes that can cause dents or scratches. The ramp’s anti‑slip surface, combined with wheel chocks and ratchet lashings, secures the car in a fixed position, ensuring zero‑scratch transit throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the live GPS tracking integrated with the enclosed container trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each enclosed trailer is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that streams real‑time location data to a secure dashboard. Customers receive instant updates via SMS or email, allowing them to monitor the exact position of their vehicle from Bagaha to the destination hub, enhancing transparency and trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim GST reimbursement for my car move from Bagaha?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad issues IBA‑approved GST‑compliant invoices that meet central and state government standards. These bills are accepted for reimbursement by corporate, PSU, and government entities, simplifying the claim process and ensuring you receive full tax credit for the transportation expense.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the full transit insurance cover for my vehicle?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The insurance provides 100 % declared‑value coverage approved by IRDAI, protecting against accidental damage, theft, or natural hazards during transit. In the unlikely event of a claim, the policy guarantees prompt settlement, giving you complete financial protection for your car throughout the Bagaha route.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero‑scratch delivery for new car deliveries?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee combines hydraulic ramp loading, 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, and custom wooden crates for fragile components. Trained loaders follow a strict SOP, and every vehicle is inspected before and after transport, ensuring that a brand‑new car arrives in pristine condition.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time from Bagaha to major transport hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 850 km journey via national highways and multi‑axle express freight lanes usually takes 12‑14 hours, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Our route planning includes real‑time monitoring and contingency stops, ensuring timely delivery without compromising safety.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer door‑to‑door service for two‑wheelers as well as cars?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Alongside car transportation, we provide dedicated two‑wheeler carriers equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings. The same doorstep pickup, live tracking, and insurance coverage apply, giving Bagaha residents a seamless solution for all vehicle relocation needs.</p>
